2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-21T14:35:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:04Z","closed_at":"2025-05-22T17:22:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106678","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106678.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106678.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-22T17:22:10Z"},"body":"The example `EditorImportPlugin` code in the class reference does not work because it didn't override methods like `_get_priority()`, `_get_import_order()`, and `_get_option_visibility()`.\r\n\r\n- `_get_priority()` and `_get_import_order()`: These two methods have documented default value. This PR allows not overridding these two methods. Default values mentioned in the documentation will be used in this case.\r\n- `_get_option_visibility()`: This method is for advanced usage and should provide a default implementation that always returns true, making all options visible.\r\n\r\nOther changes:\r\n\r\n- `_get_preset_count()`: Defaults to zero when not overridden.\r\n- `_get_preset_name()`: When not overridden and the preset count is positive, the editor errors and uses an empty string as the preset name, making the dropdown menu look broken. This PR makes it return the preset index as the error return value.\r\n- Fixed broken preset menu when `_get_preset_count()` mistakenly returns a negative value. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}",